    2: class HashingFoVerEmbedder:
    1:     """Deterministic local embedding fallback for FoVer response text.
       
           The requested experiment is about the energy recurrence, not about spending
           GPU time on a sentence-transformer.  A signed hashing embedder gives stable
           dense vectors with the same 384-dimensional MiniLM convention already used
           in nearby Carnot experiments, and it works offline in CI.
